## UI / visual work
- Anything that changes what a user sees: design it first as an SVG spec with the svg-ui-bridge
  skill (`/svg-ui-bridge:svg-ui-bridge` when installed as a plugin, `svg-ui-bridge` when uploaded to
  the account), get my approval in its browser preview, then implement per component and prove it
  with visual_diff. With superpowers this happens inside brainstorming's design step, not instead of it.
- Visual change requests edit the SVG first; the SVG in `design/` is the source of truth for looks.
